        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gino Cassinis, Luigi Einaudi\n- Organizations: Order of Merit of the Italian Republic\n- Honors: Knight Grand Cross, Grand Officer\n\nFacts:\n- In 1951, Luigi Einaudi founded the Order of Merit of the Italian Republic as the senior order of knighthood of the Italian Republic.\n- The Order of Merit of the Italian Republic is Italian: \"Ordine al merito della Repubblica Italiana.\"\n- Gino Cassinis was a Knight Grand Cross and a Grand Officer of the Order of Merit of the Italian Republic.",
